[{"source":"about.md","text":"I grew up in wilmington delaware. Both of my grandfathers were engineers, and I spent my summers tinkering away with them in the garage. I believe that art and engineering are inherintly linked, they're both products of human enginuity and creativity. I don't believe you can have one without the other. In highschool, I took every oportunity I could to build things. In 9th grade, I worked at an after-school stem camp, teaching younger students 3D printing, Arduino's etc.I moved to Philly in 2021 to enroll in Temple University. Graphic design always felt like the most natural combination of my love of tech and art. I graduated in 2025 with a BFA in graphic design, and a minor in computer science.","vector":[0.00682,0.05271,0.03578,-0.05612,-0.01693,-0.00555,-0.03378,0.04387,-0.02028,-0.03333,-0.02532,0.01233,0.01469,0.01375,-0.01276,0.02968,-0.05672,0.0312,0.00171,-0.00759,0.03298,-0.0621,0.01263,-0.05137,0.06526,0.04037,0.04878,0.01196,0.03175,-0.12728,0.00796,0.04808,-0.00848,-0.0504,-0.01195,0.02943,-0.0101,0.02727,0.01338,-0.01663,-0.05212,-0.01511,-0.01987,-0.03603,0.0279,0.03603,-0.03778,-0.04178,-0.01792,0.01104,0.02633,-0.01615,0.02213,0.0471,-0.03957,0.06498,0.03779,-0.0225,-0.0235,0.01309,-0.00443,0.03471,-0.18668,0.13064,0.02074,0.03571,-0.02348,0.01075,-0.01676,0.02237,-0.01136,-0.00538,-0.02126,0.03747,0.064,-0.0236,0.01004,-0.02437,-0.0027,-0.08789,0.06079,-0.063,-0.01376,-0.00581,-0.01543,0.03659,0.00509,-0.00394,0.01275,0.03251,-0.00771,-0.05267,-0.00211,-0.0003,0.01912,0.01463,0.03214,0.00449,-0.01008,0.4731,-0.06191,0.01021,0.10225,-0.02058,-0.03145,0.0042,0.00684,-0.00973,-0.02841,0.00854,0.00313,0.03831,-0.02902,-0.00896,0.05124,-0.05051,-0.01478,-0.0054,0.08181,-0.06888,-0.02164,0.06411,-0.03066,-0.02445,-0.05939,-0.14598,-0.01416,0.06724,-0.03103,-0.00111,0.01205,0.03074,0.00974,0.00966,-0.0223,0.05781,-0.00228,-0.01238,0.01662,0.04404,0.02314,0.05839,0.04445,-0.03403,-0.02438,0.01177,0.06909,0.0569,0.02742,0.04402,-